#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2243 expect=skipped domain=TS
#note "DELIBERATELY NO TSVCDREF COLUMN. The machine-emitted var_exists(\"TSVCDREF\") conjunct folds FALSE -> no violation, with the rule executing. This rule is the batch's sharpest ABSENT-vs-EMPTY contrast: the two produce OPPOSITE verdicts on the SAME rule and sit side by side in one directory - invalid_empty_tsvcdref (blank -> FIRES) against this one (column not there -> SILENT). Grounds finding SD2243-F2. PLAN-retire-corpus-transforms phase 4: the rule now declares the gate variable in Requirements.Variables.All, so the absent column takes the auditable SKIP this scenario pins (Fix #330 remedy: a presence rule reports the absence once)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
col TSVALCD  type=Char label="Parameter Value Code"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 1 | PCLAS | Cyclooxygenase Inhibitors | N0000175722
